<title>USA: Hewlett-Packard server supports StorageTek.</title>
<headline>Hewlett-Packard server supports StorageTek.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLLE, Colo 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hewlett-Packard Co has developed an enterprise server that supports one of StorageTek's tape cartridges as part of a joint development project between the two companies, Storage Technology Corp (StorageTek) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The company, which specializes in tape automation, said Hewlett-Packard's HP-UX PA-RISC-based HP 9000 enterprise server would support its high-performance RedWood tape cartridge and library product family.</p>
</text>
